High-Level Requirement:
  Summary: Change calls into automated tests for fhc projects commands
  Description: Important highlight: It is one of the advantages of we do this changes, solve the technical debts, and make all work with the same standard. Currently, has more than one way that we need call the methods of the fhc-tool when it is used as dependence.
Changes required: Pass the values/params as JSON and add the parameter JSON to guarantee that always it will return a JSON object if any customization is done into the FHC to show the result in another way to the users the tests will not affect anymore. 
Places: 
* 

Replace it for: 
{code:java}
module.exports = {
 create: cbToPromise(function(params, cb) {
 fhc.projects.create({title:params.projectName, template:params.template, 'env': 'none', json:true}, cb);
 }),
 list: cbToPromise(function(params, cb) {
 fhc.call({_:['/box/api/projects?apps=false']}, cb);
 }),
 delete: cbToPromise(function(projectId, cb) {
 fhc.projects.delete({project:projectId, json:true}, cb);
 })
};
{code}
- 
Replace it for: 
{code:java}
fhc.projects({title:params.projectName, template:params.template, 'env': 'none', json:true}, cb);
{code}
